  <span class="lini-tok-punct">}</span>
<span class="lini-tok-punct">]</span>

<span class="lini-tok-comment">// `baseline: 40` floats the fill on the target instead of zero, so a wet month</span>
<span class="lini-tok-comment">// reads as area above the line and a dry one as area below it.</span>
<span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type">chart</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span> <span class="lini-tok-string">&quot;Reservoir level (m)&quot;</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">{</span>
